# No hardcoded UI copy

User-facing text → `AppLocalization.current.*` only.

**New copy:** add the same key to `lib/l10n/intl_vi.arb` **and** `lib/l10n/intl_en.arb`, then save (auto-gen). Never edit only one ARB / never hardcode EN/VI in Dart.

Error fallback order: `Result.error` → **feature-specific** key → `errorOccurred`.

When API success has no message (e.g. resend OTP), use a dedicated l10n key (e.g. `otpResentMessage`).

Details: `.agents/rules/localization.md`
